Authors: A.Yu.Konobeyev, A. Stankovskiy, D.Leichtle                628 1451   15
                                                                   628 1451   16
                                                                   628 1451   17
                                                                   628 1451   18
Data evaluation was peformed using experimental data [1-16] and    628 1451   19
results of model calculations.                                     628 1451   20
                                                                   628 1451   21
Cross sections were calculated using various codes and nuclear     628 1451   22
models [17-21]. Results served both for comparison and control,    628 1451   23
and were used directly for evaluation.                             628 1451   24
                                                                   628 1451   25
The following codes were used:                                     628 1451   26
                                                                   628 1451   27
 - ALICE/ASH with emission of heavy clusters [17],                 628 1451   28
                                                                   628 1451   29
 - TALYS [18] applying different models for the calculation of     628 1451   30
   nuclear level density with ldmodel parameter from 1 to 3,       628 1451   31
                                                                   628 1451   32
 - TALYS-G [19] implementing the GDH model of M.Blann,             628 1451   33
                                                                   628 1451   34
 - CEM03 [20],                                                     628 1451   35
                                                                   628 1451   36
 - PHITS [21]                                                      628 1451   37
                                                                   628 1451   38
The latest versions of TALYS and PHITS codes used correspond to    628 1451   39
the time of the evaluation.                                        628 1451   40
                                                                   628 1451   41
The (p,g) cross-section below 2 MeV was taken from ENDF/B-VIII.    628 1451   42
